{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>The first of my strength.</b> It is the first drop — that he had not seen a seminal emission all his days (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>My strength.</b> My power, as in ״מָצָאתִי אוֹן לִי״ (Hosea 12), ״מֵרֹב אוֹנִים״, and ״לְאֵין אוֹנִים״ (Isaiah 40)." "<b>Excess of dignity.</b> You were worthy to be excess over your brothers in priesthood — a term of raising the hands in priestly blessing." "<b>And excess of might.</b> In kingship, as in: ״וְיִתֶּן עֹז לְמַלְכּוֹ״ (1 Samuel 2). And what caused you to lose all these?"], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:00.224291782Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}